1
00:00:03,071 --> 00:00:06,006
50 years have passed.

2
00:00:06,040 --> 00:00:09,943
But I do not age.

3
00:00:12,413 --> 00:00:16,717
Time has lost its effect on me.

4
00:00:20,854 --> 00:00:24,692
Yet the suffering continues.

5
00:00:26,260 --> 00:00:28,762
Aku's grasp chokes the past,

6
00:00:28,796 --> 00:00:32,366
present, and future.

7
00:00:32,400 --> 00:00:36,270
Hope is lost.

8
00:00:36,304 --> 00:00:38,506
Got to get back --

9
00:00:38,539 --> 00:00:40,441
back to the past.

10
00:00:40,474 --> 00:00:42,176
Samurai Jack.

11
00:02:22,310 --> 00:02:23,544
They're coming!

12
00:03:32,313 --> 00:03:33,247
Huh?

13
00:04:25,032 --> 00:04:27,167
Aah!!

14
00:04:51,559 --> 00:04:53,226
Look at you.

15
00:04:57,798 --> 00:04:59,700
You've survived worse.

16
00:05:02,235 --> 00:05:05,473
This isn't about
your pathetic little cut.

17
00:05:05,506 --> 00:05:07,641
It's about
that girl you killed.

18
00:05:09,242 --> 00:05:12,346
We've never killed a human
before, have we?

19
00:05:12,380 --> 00:05:16,116
Sure, mountains
of robot corpses.

20
00:05:16,149 --> 00:05:17,317
But this?

21
00:05:17,351 --> 00:05:20,220
This was
the first human being.

22
00:05:20,253 --> 00:05:23,190
Real flesh and blood.

23
00:05:24,257 --> 00:05:26,226
What happens
when the others find you?

24
00:05:26,259 --> 00:05:27,895
You'll have to kill them, too.

25
00:05:27,928 --> 00:05:29,062
Can you?

26
00:05:29,897 --> 00:05:33,066
Will you be able to
when the time comes?

27
00:05:33,100 --> 00:05:35,603
Maybe they will kill you.

28
00:05:36,404 --> 00:05:38,906
Or is that what you want?

29
00:05:38,939 --> 00:05:40,608
No.

30
00:07:02,155 --> 00:07:03,824
Emperor!

31
00:07:03,857 --> 00:07:07,995
Your guards are dead,
and you are next!

32
00:07:12,833 --> 00:07:15,335
Your choices have
clearly led you here,

33
00:07:15,368 --> 00:07:17,471
as have mine.

34
00:07:17,505 --> 00:07:20,007
I will give you
a new choice.

35
00:07:20,040 --> 00:07:22,342
Leave now and live

36
00:07:22,375 --> 00:07:25,112
or stay
and face your destiny.

37
00:07:25,145 --> 00:07:26,413
Ha!

38
00:07:26,446 --> 00:07:30,183
Your Bushido nonsense
means nothing to us.

39
00:07:30,217 --> 00:07:33,353
Your destiny is death!

40
00:07:49,302 --> 00:07:50,504
Huh?

41
00:10:39,239 --> 00:10:44,611
The decisions you make
and the actions that follow

42
00:10:44,644 --> 00:10:48,048
are a reflection
of who you are.

43
00:10:48,081 --> 00:10:51,318
You cannot hide
from yourself.

44
00:11:23,550 --> 00:11:26,053
Death is failure.

45
00:12:12,766 --> 00:12:15,202
Follow the river.

46
00:12:35,522 --> 00:12:36,756
I'll take watch.

47
00:13:09,990 --> 00:13:11,291
Samurai blood.

48
00:13:11,324 --> 00:13:13,493
The river guides
our way.

49
00:13:54,201 --> 00:13:56,003
What...is that?

50
00:13:56,036 --> 00:13:57,270
Quiet!

51
00:14:01,174 --> 00:14:03,543
Mother told us
there would be other creatures.

52
00:14:05,345 --> 00:14:06,079
Wait.

53
00:14:06,113 --> 00:14:08,048
Something else approaches.

54
00:14:08,081 --> 00:14:09,482
Is it with the Samurai?

55
00:14:09,516 --> 00:14:10,683
Should we kill it?

56
00:14:16,189 --> 00:14:18,158
Aku.

57
00:14:18,191 --> 00:14:20,393
It is surely
one of his minions.

58
00:14:20,427 --> 00:14:22,462
It will devour
the weaker one.

59
00:14:29,903 --> 00:14:31,771
What madness is this?

60
00:14:31,804 --> 00:14:33,273
What are they doing?

61
00:14:35,042 --> 00:14:37,277
I...don't know.

62
00:14:37,310 --> 00:14:38,878
Well, I don't like it.

63
00:14:41,714 --> 00:14:43,016
Look.

64
00:15:30,497 --> 00:15:32,832
You have chosen this path.

65
00:15:32,865 --> 00:15:36,269
Life works
in strange ways.

66
00:15:36,303 --> 00:15:40,707
Your choices have clearly
led you here, as have mine.

67
00:15:41,975 --> 00:15:44,744
I will give you
a new choice.

68
00:15:44,777 --> 00:15:47,280
Leave here now and live

69
00:15:47,314 --> 00:15:50,483
or stay
and face your destiny.

70
00:15:50,517 --> 00:15:53,153
Our destiny
is your death!

71
00:15:54,054 --> 00:15:57,390
So...
I guess you're staying.

72
00:16:03,997 --> 00:16:05,932
Perhaps I was unclear.

73
00:16:05,965 --> 00:16:07,267
Enough words!

74
00:16:07,300 --> 00:16:10,470
Show yourself, Samurai,
so you can die!

75
00:16:10,503 --> 00:16:11,771
Very well.

76
00:16:11,804 --> 00:16:15,942
The decisions you make
and the actions that follow

77
00:16:15,975 --> 00:16:18,178
are a reflection of --
Shut up!

78
00:16:18,211 --> 00:16:20,880
...of who you really are.

79
00:18:32,779 --> 00:18:34,281
Aaaaaah!

80
00:21:11,103 --> 00:21:12,605
You worthless scum!

81
00:21:12,639 --> 00:21:13,740
I will kill you!

82
00:21:13,773 --> 00:21:16,008
You can never escape
from Aku!

83
00:21:16,042 --> 00:21:17,410
You will die!

84
00:21:17,444 --> 00:21:19,446
You will die
a horrible death,

85
00:21:19,479 --> 00:21:20,813
and then Aku will sing,

86
00:21:20,847 --> 00:21:24,083
for he is free
from the parasite that you are!

87
00:21:24,116 --> 00:21:25,318
Die, Samurai!

88
00:21:25,352 --> 00:21:26,953
Die, die, you scum!

89
00:21:26,986 --> 00:21:28,321
Die! Die!

90
00:21:28,355 --> 00:21:29,356
Die, Samurai!

91
00:21:29,389 --> 00:21:32,258
You will...diiiiiie!

92
00:21:41,568 --> 00:21:44,937
Aaaaaaaaaaaaah!

93
00:21:47,707 --> 00:21:49,542
* Watch out
* Got to get back

94
00:21:49,576 --> 00:21:51,644
* Jack, Jack, Jack
* Back to the past,
Samurai Jack *

95
00:21:51,678 --> 00:21:54,414
* Jack, Jack, Jack, Jack
* Wa-Watch out

96
00:21:58,084 --> 00:21:59,986
* Got to get back,
back to the past *

97
00:22:00,019 --> 00:22:01,153
* Samurai Jack

98
00:22:01,187 --> 00:22:02,489
* Watch out

99
00:22:05,492 --> 00:22:08,027
* Jack, Jack,
Jack, Jack, Jack *

100
00:22:11,163 --> 00:22:12,131
* Watch out

101
00:22:12,164 --> 00:22:13,500
* Got to get back

102
00:22:13,533 --> 00:22:15,301
* Samurai Jack
* Jack, Jack, Jack

103
00:22:15,334 --> 00:22:17,904
* Wa-Watch out
* Jack, Jack, Jack, Jack
